      1. Selenium WebDriver
          Selenium WebDriver is a browser automation tool that allows us to control web browsers programmatically using programming languages 
          such as Java, Python, C- sharp, and JavaScript.
          In simple words, WebDriver allows our Java program to interact with a website automatically.

